---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-tinta-700 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12">
    <div class="garis-buku pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-white sm:text-3xl">
        Kami percaya setiap mimpi berhak mendapat kesempatan untuk tumbuh.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-tinta-100">
        Mari bersama melukis masa depan yang lebih cerah di atas setiap kertas kosong para generasi bangsa.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/ayo-terlibat" class="tombol bg-white text-tinta-800 hover:bg-tinta-50">
          Ayo Terlibat <Icon name="ArrowRight" class="size-4" />
        </a>
        <a href="/kontak" class="tombol border border-white/30 text-white hover:bg-white/10">Hubungi kami</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
